    {
      "text": "It's 2 AM. You're exhausted, so why is your brain finally doing this?",
      "caps": ["It's 2 AM.", "You're exhausted —", "so why is your brain finally doing this?"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember when you waved back at someone who wasn't even waving?",
      "caps": ["Remember when you waved back", "at someone who wasn't even waving?"]
    },
    {
      "text": "It's not random. When you finally stop, your prefrontal cortex clocks out.",
      "caps": ["It's not random.", "When you finally stop,", "your prefrontal cortex clocks out."]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every memory it was blocking rushes the stage.",
      "caps": ["Every memory it was blocking", "rushes the stage."]
    },
    {
      "text": "No daylight, no task, no distraction, so your brain tags every cringe as urgent.",
      "caps": ["No daylight, no task,", "no distraction —", "so your brain tags every cringe", "as urgent."]
    },
    {
      "text": "And then it replays them. Loudly. On loop.",
      "caps": ["And then it replays them.", "Loudly.", "On loop."]
    },
    {
      "text": "The fix? Not your phone.",
      "caps": ["The fix?", "Not your phone."]
    },
    {
      "text": "Breathe. Name it. Let it pass.",
      "caps": ["Breathe.", "Name it.", "Let it pass."]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now close your eyes. It's just a memory.",
      "caps": ["Now close your eyes.", "It's just a memory."]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tomorrow night, your brain picks better.",
      "caps": ["Tomorrow night,", "your brain picks better."]
